  "details": "- Add a button(s) that when the camera is out increases or decreases the current level of zoom.\n\n- A button different than the scroll wheel so we can move the camera and zoom simultaneously.\n\n- Ideally allows for a smooth change in zoom, not a jump in value.\n\n- Ideally a slider to adjust the speed of zoom adjust from these buttons would be nice as well.\n\n- Ideally these buttons should be able to be remapped to a button of our choosing for individual preference.\n\nThis will combat the issue of not being able to zoom while moving your camera around. It will allow the desktop camera to function more like a real camera, and prevent the need to stop tracking whatever you are filming to adjust your zoom. Which often ruins the shot.\n\nPlease and Thank you from an avid desktop videographer.",
